4
00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:18.897
Tangira ufite isuku y'intoki kandi wimenyekanishe wenyine.

5
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:19.460
Emeza

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.305
umwirondoro wumurwayi, sobanura ikizamini kandi wemererwe kubikora.

7
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:26.140
Banza ufate

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.841
amasegonda make kugirango witegereze amaso yombi icyarimwe.

9
00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:31.860
Reba kuri periorbitor, ijisho na

10
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:37.540
amaso, gutanga ibisobanuro kubyimba byose, gutukura no gusohora, kimwe no gukomera kwamaso

11
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.694
cyangwa imyanya idasanzwe y'amaso.

12
00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:44.540
Noneho kora ikizamini kinini ukoresheje urumuri rwa arc.

13
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.966
Fungura itara ryera hanyuma ufate igikoresho hafi yijisho ryawe.

14
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:49.020
Buhoro buhoro wegera umurwayi

15
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.277
ijisho ryiburyo ubanza kugeza ryibanze.

16
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:53.252
Ibi bizaba hafi cm 6.

17
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.380
Baza umurwayi

18
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.940
shyira ijisho hanze n'imbere, hanyuma hejuru no hepfo, mugihe ufashe buhoro buhoro,

19
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:03.442
muburyo bwerekana gahunda itandukanye, kubitekereza mumatsinda.

20
00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:04.260
Iya mbere

21
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:11.360
Iri tsinda ririmo ijisho ryo hejuru no hepfo hamwe no gupfundikanya, icya kabiri kirimo conjunctiva

22
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:16.220
na sclera, hamwe na forenax yo hepfo.

23
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.552
Itsinda rya gatatu ni cornea, ihuriro ryibi na sclera yitwa

24
00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:21.480
limbis, na

25
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.380
imboni y'ijisho, akikijwe na iris.

26
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.940
Umaze kurangiza kubona izi nyubako zose, komeza usuzume ubujyakuzimu bwimbere.

27
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.100
Icyumba cy'imbere ni umwanya uri hagati ya cornea na iris.

28
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.514
Kumurika urumuri kuruhande rwigihe gito, ubujyakuzimu bwicyumba cyimbere

29
00:01:38.514 --> 00:01:39.460
birashobora gusuzumwa.

30
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:44.220
Igicucu ku mazuru iris irashobora kwerekana icyumba cyimbere.

31
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.380
Nibizamini bisanzwe bidafite igicucu.

32
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.020
Noneho hitamo itara ry'ubururu kumuri arc.

33
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.140
Hamwe na fluorescing irangi ya firime yamosozi, ahantu hazabura epiteliyale nindwara bizagaragazwa.

34
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.140
Irangi rya fluoresces ryaka cyane hamwe nubururu bwubururu.

35
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.200
igishushanyo ikibanza nubunini bwibice byo gutakaza epiteliyale nindwara.

36
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.300
Byarangiye usuzumye isahani isumba iyindi, shyira ipamba kumupfundikizo wo hejuru,

37
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:14.400
