38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.920
Ubwa mbere byarebwaga nijisho ryonyine, hanyuma uzane urumuri rwa arc kugirango ubone ibintu binini.

39
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Subiramo iki kizamini kurundi jisho.

40
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.360
Nyuma yaho, shimira umurwayi, uvuge muri make inyandiko zavumbuwe kandi usubiremo isuku y'intoki.

41
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.360
Nyamuneka reba andi mashuri makuru ya kaminuza ya St Andrews Arc Umucyo.
